  "notes": "Often used in business, economic, and political contexts. Both the intransitive ({倍増|ばいぞう}する) and the transitive/causative ({倍増|ばいぞう}させる) forms are common.\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n・{売上|うりあげ}が{倍増|ばいぞう}する (sales double)\n・{予算|よさん}を{倍増|ばいぞう}させる (double the budget)\n・{生産量|せいさんりょう}の{倍増|ばいぞう} (doubling of production)\n・{所得|しょとく}{倍増|ばいぞう}{計画|けいかく} (income doubling plan)",
